Wuji UniLab / SuperMimic task adaptations

The Hand 1 and Pen Spin SuperMimic learner in
src/unisupermimic/rl/algos/dex_supermimic is adapted from CumulusAlpha's
Dex-Supermimic reference implementation:
https://github.com/CumulusAlpha/Dex-Supermimic
The simulation boundary is adapted to UniLab. Original task LICENSE and
NOTICE files are retained in tasks/dex_reorient/hand1 and tasks/pen_spin.
The Hand 1 asset loader and rig configuration are adapted from wuji-mjlab.

Pen Spin's pseudo-inertia helpers in tasks/pen_spin/inertia.py are adapted
from mujocolab/mjlab v1.6.0, commit
0fb8a681136be94ffc636a3dd423cabb97d91f10, src/mjlab/envs/mdp/dr/body.py.
The upstream Apache-2.0 license is included as LICENSE. Quaternion utility
imports are bound to the local wxyz rotation API.

Existing SuperMimic and SuperMimic-Reproduced MIT notices are preserved in
LICENSES/MIT-supermimic.txt and LICENSES/MIT-supermimic-reproduced.txt.
